  "description": "The ANCHEER Fbdan11 Electric Trike is designed for riders who prioritize comfort, stability, and everyday practicality. It is equipped with a 1000W peak power motor, providing smooth acceleration and reliable climbing ability. The 864Wh removable battery provides a maximum range of up to 60 miles, meeting the needs of commuting, shopping, or weekend adventures. Its parking brake system, differential gear, and other stability-enhancing three-wheel design features ensure superior balance and safety, while the low step-through frame makes mounting and dismounting effortless.The Fbdan11 features 20 x 4.0 inches wide tires, a spacious rear cargo basket, a 7-speed drivetrain, and a sensitive cadence sensor, perfectly blending comfort, practicality, and reliability to help you enjoy every ride. Whether you are commuting or exploring, the ANCHEER Fbdan11 tricycle provides a safe, comfortable, and powerful riding experience—making it the ideal choice for daily commutes, shopping trips, and everyday travel.",
